<section class="faq-section section" id="faq">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center">
      <span class="section__eyebrow">Got Questions?</span>
      <h2 class="section__title" style="color:var(--navy)">
        Frequently Asked Questions
      </h2>
      <p class="section__subtitle">
        Everything you need to know before ordering.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="faq-list" data-animate>

      <li class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">
          Will AirGuard™ damage my windows or leave residue?
          <span class="faq-question__icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer__inner">
            Absolutely not. AirGuard™ is engineered with a clean-release adhesive formula. When removed, it leaves zero residue and causes no damage to glass, vinyl, wood, or painted surfaces. It's safe for renters too!
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">
          Can I use it on doors as well as windows?
          <span class="faq-question__icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer__inner">
            Yes! AirGuard™ works on windows, doors, vents, pipes, attic hatches, and any gap or crack in your home. Anywhere cold air gets in — AirGuard™ keeps it out.
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">
          How long does AirGuard™ last?
          <span class="faq-question__icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer__inner">
            AirGuard™ is designed to last through an entire winter season and beyond. Our UV-resistant formula protects against degradation from sun exposure, and the weatherproof adhesive holds strong through extreme temperatures, rain, and humidity.
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">
          Is AirGuard™ really waterproof?
          <span class="faq-question__icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer__inner">
            Yes — 100% waterproof. The adhesive and tape material are fully resistant to water, moisture, and humidity. It works just as well in bathrooms, basements, or anywhere condensation is an issue.
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">
          Will it actually lower my heating bill?
          <span class="faq-question__icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer__inner">
            Based on customer feedback and US Department of Energy research, properly sealing air leaks can reduce heating and cooling costs by 5–30% annually. Many AirGuard™ customers report savings within the very first month.
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">
          How much tape do I need for my home?
          <span class="faq-question__icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer__inner">
            One roll (20 yards) is typically enough for 4–6 standard windows. For a full apartment or small home, we recommend 2–3 rolls. Our 3-pack bundle is the most popular option and offers the best per-roll savings.
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">
          What is your return policy?
          <span class="faq-question__icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer__inner">
            We offer a 30-day money back guarantee. If you're not completely satisfied for any reason, contact our support team within 30 days of delivery for a full refund — no questions asked.
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">
          How fast does it ship?
          <span class="faq-question__icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer__inner">
            We ship from US warehouses. Most orders are processed within 1–2 business days and arrive within 3–5 business days. You'll receive a tracking number via email as soon as your order ships.
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

    </ul>

    <div class="text-center" style="margin-top:48px" data-animate>
      <p style="font-size:1rem;color:var(--gray-600);margin-bottom:20px">
        Still have questions? We're here to help.
      </p>
      <a href="mailto:support@airguardtape.com" class="btn btn--secondary" style="color:var(--navy);border-color:var(--gray-200)">
        📧 Contact Support
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{"name": "FAQ"}]
}
{% endschema %}
